# The image is public, so the build context is an allow-list: only what the
# Dockerfile copies goes in. .env, data/, logs/ and everything else stay out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!scripts/
!ui/

# Clutter inside the allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store
